body: "## Repro (real data)\n\n1. pm create + pm update --release 2026.6.1 + pm close (closed_at = today)\n2. Multi-window: pm-changelog --all-release-tags -> item under '## 2026.6.1' (correct, honors release)\n3. Single-window: pm-changelog --release-version 2026.7.24 --since <today> -> item under '## 2026.7.24' (wrong, ignores release)\n\n## Fix direction\n\nHonor the release field in the single-window path behind an opt-in flag so default output stays byte-identical for the 18 fleet consumers whose CI runs changelog:check."
